ss&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8r3k7f5HPh4Q7kNvwHuk5-C&_nc_oc=AdroUrVsLdXf_0UOlP60Hg3FQMlrfIBBkh-2X7HQTVtSTLxHdFbcxFc4ckvpOWIBAcg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQSiEI0sGJ3vUlqVvqZU1ul864iXwt-jA8h2fMTILpczJA&oe=6B0DD2B6"}, {"file_name": "capture final.png", "id": "913405551109535", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824307_913405554442868_4620760491231566657_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=M8_wJDLsmQcQ7kNvwF4_rDa&_nc_oc=AdpJILQCeLAf0tXyxH-x-G2PdZMcIq5KfTk17KwLEFpyEeJpalT1P8vgRzlYLGtixlE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQQGMqx-eV4WirkeNgB9Ip_MBnIi60bziJSlYSUcnh-t-Q&oe=6B0DD1EC"}, {"file_name": "capture 1.png", "id": "783698660711990", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310651_783698664045323_5210865340295355557_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0T0FTWqK2CMQ7kNvwFGIWm4&_nc_oc=AdrxErojEo2_9aQ5pnlHLyk1UHP34bBsz5XRDH0vvGH4Q2qt1md1r57VHsNkKkvCD80&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQR1AaMZmMueHQBdIjogJ-5NQBIpibI4vqcLcr2QjIzD-g&oe=6B0D9C73"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CM StoRE - couverture paysage.png", "id": "1415640733376481", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822863_1415640736709814_2754899795012134397_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Pmeyb-7w41UQ7kNvwHTp3UK&_nc_oc=Ado5GRGLlyWrnCE-vrg0XPEKXpHQ_32SLebScOIV0Bh1yquMD-q5ajt1D6iEK766Gqg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQTNhIq4rq5trGWF6f5RWZUQJmNyHssaxg19jlJjfmxBBQ&oe=6B0DD2FC"}, "display_name": "Cr\u00eape Master! Alpha", "keywords": ["combat", "magic", "crepe", "spell", "action"], "long_description": "# Cr\u00eape Master! Alpha is a fun solo adventure in magical girl style! Become a Cr\u00eape Goddess and protect earth against an alien army!\n\n# Features: \n\n1. BONK WITH YOUR MAGICAL PAN: Mix heavy and light hits,break guards, and take back the stolen ingredients! \n{1401849871406732}\n\n2. CRAFT SPELLS WITH INGREDIENTS: To cast spells you have to craft them prior. Enter a Crepo-Trance, grab the right ingredients, and mix up cr\u00eapes at a lightning speed. Unleash them later in battle with a pose!\n{793123986817059}\n\n3. MAGICAL GIRL POSE: Pose like a true Magical Girl to summon your freshly cooked cr\u00eapes and cast powerful spells. Just move your arms and fire them off!\n{894263426315476}\n\n# YOUR STORY: YOU ARE A CR\u00caPE GODDESS HANA\u2026.\n\nIn the far reaches of space, a tyrant has sworn to destroy the Cr\u00eape, the universal symbol of joy and community. \n\nOn Earth, an ordinary student finds a ruby-studded pan and, by cooking the best cr\u00eape in the universe, awakens the powers of the Cr\u00eape Goddess!\n\nShe then learns a shocking secret: our planet is actually a cr\u00eape\u2026 and therefore flat. If the Cr\u00eape is destroyed, the world will fall with it....\n\n-> If you like the concept and want to support development (or just share cr\u00eape memes), join our Discord community and give us your feedback! \nhttps://discord.com/invite/8qcQHspEAr\n\n\n", "short_description": "Cr\u00eape Master! is a fast and crazy combat game where you fight like a magical girl. Become the Cr\u00eape Goddess, smash aliens with your magical pan and cast cr\u00eape-powered spells by striking real magical girl poses with your arms.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://hallucinations-studio.com/cm_privacy_policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Hallucinations Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.hallucinations-studio.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "